            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TastyPeach2433"
            },
            "reviewBody": "If you like bitter marmalade you'll love this! I followed the other reviewer's advice and halved the Campari and Vermouth (I figure it's easier to add more than it is to take it out!), then added more Vermouth. My ratios ended up like this - 1.5 whiskey: 1 Vermouth: 0.5 Campari",
            "datePublished": "2024-12-01T08:47:49.684Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CookingWithShelia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Initially, I made the cocktail exactly as the recipe said...it is heavy on the Campari in my opinion. So, I made it again and I decrease the sweet vermouth and the campari to a little less than 1/2 an ounce each. In my opinion that made a BIG difference in the overall taste.",
            "datePublished": "2023-11-21T03:16:56.179Z"
          }
